        <div class="oaf-footer__legal">
          <p>
            <a href="https://www.oaf.org.au/">OpenAustralia Foundation</a> is a
            <a href="https://www.acnc.gov.au/charity/charities/6bf25724-39af-e811-a960-000d3ad24282/profile">registered charity</a>
